-- 登记: D5-pjoi-beam-aps | 语义: 把柱 /SB3/PANEL/1/COL/C03 的两端写回 W 1250 N 1250 U 170 / U 5250
-- expected_net: cancelled | restore 搭档: 本文件是 joint/aps_pjoi_beam_apply.mac 的 restore | 库: aps7166（APS 副本，MDB /SDNF）
-- 写的是绝对值，重跑幂等。期望与 apply 对称：重建柱 C03 与端板主关节两件，端板回到原来的原点。
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P SUITE-T2-JOINT-APS-PJOI-BEAM-RESTORE-ALIVE
=23550/1066
Q REF
Q NAME
Q POS WRT /*
/SB3/PANEL/1/COL/C03
Q REF
Q NAME
Q TYPE
Q POSS
Q POSE
POSS E -1250 N 1250 U 170
POSE E -1250 N 1250 U 5250
Q POSS
Q POSE
Q DRNS
Q DRNE
Q JOIS
Q JOIE
=23550/1066
Q CREF
Q DESP
Q CUTB
Q DELP
Q POS WRT /*
Q ORI WRT /*
=23550/1065
Q REF
Q NAME
Q NPOS
SAVEWORK 'AIOS suite T2 joint/aps_pjoi_beam restore: column C03 back to W 1250'
$P SUITE-T2-JOINT-APS-PJOI-BEAM-RESTORE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
